{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-11-04 09:09:00', 'title': "GRID MODERNIZATION WORK UNDERWAY IN THE ILLUMINATING COMPANY'S EASTERN CUYAHOGA COUNTY SERVICE AREA", 'text': 'CLEVELAND, NOV. 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE ILLUMINATING COMPANY, A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP (NYSE: FE), IS MODERNIZING ITS ELECTRIC SYSTEM IN EASTERN CUYAHOGA COUNTY TO HELP PREVENT OR MINIMIZE THE LENGTH OF POWER OUTAGES. THE WORK INCLUDES INSTALLATION OF NEW, AUTOMATED EQUIPMENT AND TECHNOLOGY IN SUBSTATIONS AND ALONG POWER LINES SERVING MORE THAN 25,000 CUSTOMERS IN PARTS OF BEDFORD, BEDFORD HEIGHTS, WARRENSVILLE HEIGHTS, GARFIELD HEIGHTS, WALTON HILLS, VALLEY VIEW AND NEARBY AREAS.'}